  "description": "Say hello to your new favorite way to ride. The Batch E-Step-Thru is designed for comfort, confidence, and the kind of easy-going fun that makes you want to ride every day. Powered by the Bosch Active Line motor, this e-bike offers gentle pedal-assist support with 40Nm of torque, giving you just the boost you need without overwhelming your natural ride feel. The 400Wh Bosch Powerpack offers ample range for errands, commutes, or leisurely rides around the neighborhood.\nA low step-thru frame, paired with adjustable stem, upright handlebars, and Kenda comfort tires, makes it easy for anyone to hop on and enjoy the ride. Whether you choose Gloss White or Blood Red, the E-Step-Thru brings style and substance in equal measure. With trusted Shimano and Tektro components, this e-bike is built to last — and built to make riding more enjoyable, every single time.",
